m/vimeo/psalm/issues/62#issuecomment-272926718","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/62","id":272926718,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MjkyNjcxOA==","user":{"login":"svivian","id":207887,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzg4Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207887?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian","html_url":"https://github.com/svivian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-01-16T17:55:21Z","updated_at":"2017-01-16T17:55:21Z","body":"OK so it looks like the paths must be relative to the XML file rather than the project root? I think I fixed the paths but it's still not working correctly. I set up a completely separate folder to try to isolate this. I have these files:\r\n\r\n    /index.php\r\n    /psalm.xml\r\n    /src\r\n        Comment.php\r\n        /vendor\r\n            test.php\r\n\r\npsalm.xml:\r\n\r\n\t<?xml version=\"1.0\"?>\r\n\t<psalm name=\"Barebones config\" stopOnFirstError=\"false\" useDocblockTypes=\"true\">\r\n\t\t<projectFiles>\r\n\t\t\t<directory name=\"src\" />\r\n\t\t\t<ignoreFiles>\r\n\t\t\t\t<directory name=\"src/vendor\" />\r\n\t\t\t</ignoreFiles>\r\n\t\t</projectFiles>\r\n\t</psalm>\r\n\r\nindex.php:\r\n\r\n\t<?php\r\n\tinclude 'src/Comment.php';\r\n\tinclude 'src/vendor/test.php';\r\n\r\nsrc/Comment.php:\r\n\r\n\t<?php\r\n\r\n\tclass Comment\r\n\t{\r\n\t\tpublic $id;\r\n\t\tpublic $comment;\r\n\r\n\t\t/**\r\n\t\t * No params here\r\n\t\t */\r\n\t\tpublic function __construct($id, $comment='')\r\n\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t$this->id = $id;\r\n\t\t\t$this->comment = $undefined;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\r\nsrc/vendor/test.php:\r\n\r\n\t<?php\r\n\techo $unknown;\r\n\r\nHere is the output for various commands:\r\n\r\n\r\n\t$ psalm -c psalm.xml \r\n\tChecks took 0.011067867279053 and used 3.844MB\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\t$ psalm -c psalm.xml src/vendor/test.php \r\n\tChecks took 0.005871057510376 and used 2.737MB\r\n\tERROR: UndefinedVariable - src/vendor/test.php:3 - Cannot find referenced variable $unknown\r\n\techo $unknown;\r\n\r\n\r\n\tChecks took 0.0097551345825195 and used 3.175MB\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\t$ psalm -c psalm.xml src/Comment.php \r\n\tChecks took 0.0080311298370361 and used 3.845MB\r\n\tERROR: UndefinedVariable - src/Comment.php:14 - Cannot find referenced variable $undefined\r\n\t\t\t$this->comment = $undefined;\r\n\r\n\r\n\tChecks took 0.1380980014801 and used 20.174MB\r\n\r\n\r\n\t$ psalm -c psalm.xml index.php \r\n\tChecks took 0.042136907577515 and used 2.735MB\r\n\tERROR: MissingPropertyType - ./src/Comment.php:5 - Property Comment::$id does not have a declared type\r\n\t\tpublic $id;\r\n\r\n\r\n\tERROR: MissingPropertyType - ./src/Comment.php:6 - Property Comment::$comment does not have a declared type\r\n\t\tpublic $comment;\r\n\r\n\r\n\tERROR: MissingPropertyType - ./src/Comment.php:13 - Property Comment::$id does not have a declared type\r\n\t\t\t$this->id = $id;\r\n\r\n\r\n\tERROR: UndefinedVariable - ./src/Comment.php:14 - Cannot find referenced variable $undefined\r\n\t\t\t$this->comment = $undefined;\r\n\r\n\r\n\tERROR: UndefinedVariable - ./src/vendor/test.php:3 - Cannot find referenced variable $unknown\r\n\techo $unknown;\r\n\r\n\r\n\tChecks took 0.28942489624023 and used 19.909MB\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSo there is a lot of inconsistency here, and I don't know what is supposed to be the correct output in each situation.\r\n\r\n- `psalm -c psalm.xml` -- I'd expect this to check all the files in `src/` and ignore `src/vendor/`, so it should show the errors from `src/Comment.php`\r\n- `psalm -c psalm.xml src/vendor/test.php` -- seems to be correct output.\r\n- `psalm -c psalm.xml src/Comment.php` -- appears to be missing some errors.\r\n- `psalm -c psalm.xml index.php` -- this shows additional errors from Comment.php. It also shows errors from `src/vendor/` which should be ignored.\r\n\r\nLet me know if I'm misunderstanding things here :)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/comments/272926718/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"svivian","id":207887,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzg4Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207887?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian","html_url":"https://github.com/svivian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svivian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/comments/272929934","html_url":"https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/62#issuecomment-272929934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/62","id":272929934,